Architecture
Module breakdown:

UI Layer. Panel renderer, form state manager, navigation controller.

Panel Controllers. One per panel, each with field validation and rule hooks.

Rule Engine. Executes the 32 semantic rules in order; returns violations.

Label Derivation Engine. Implements Section 7.6 decision tree.

Anchoring Engine. Implements Section 1.2 conditions.

Entailment Basis Engine. Implements Section 7.3 decision tree.

Scale-Separation Calculator. Computes ratio, expansion parameter, band minimum.

Partition Audit Engine. Implements Sections 5.8, 7.7, 7.8.

Schema Validator. Runs JSON Schema and SHACL.

PROV-O Exporter. Maps record to PROV-O.

Persistence Layer. Saves and loads JSON records.

Audit Logger. Records rules checked, fields populated, flags attached.

Data flow:

User input goes to Panel Controller, which updates Form State. On panel exit, Rule Engine runs. Label Derivation Engine computes label. Anchoring Engine computes anchoring status. On save, Schema Validator runs. Then Persistence or Export.

